window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A year ago, we managed to escape the realm of monsters, unscathed.</p> <p>The mistake of trying to strike a bargain with the High King has been buried in the past . . .</p> <p>Or so we thought.</p> <p>Tensions rise when the people in our kingdom seek blood, claiming a beast massacred one of the villages around Hell Hold.</p> <p>Pitchforks burn and the fine line between good and evil blurs until it's nearly obliterated all together.</p> <p>However, one thing is crystal clear. We're not only gearing up for war with Heaven, but a civil war within Hell itself.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
